PR #409 has an independent ACCEPT on its current commit, `96bdf612`, but CI there hasn't finished, so it isn't merged yet. I'm watching CI in the background and will merge if every check passes.

The second review confirmed both medium findings and the over-budget case are fixed:
- only the skills list is swapped, never the rest of the prompt;
- it's re-sized once when the provider's window becomes known, then only if the window shrinks;
- the list never exceeds its limit.

I left the five remaining low items out of #409, since each fix would mean another CI and review round. They're now recorded under WP-1308 in plan PR #410. One matters to you: a conversation saved before this fix keeps its oversized skills list, so the failed citable conversation will still be blocked if you resume it. Starting a new conversation there works.

